Description: GHSA-rgrp-mwpx-f6rm: unbounded recursion in ext/soap: a deeply nested WSDL or SOAP message, or a chain or loop of href references, no longer overflows the stack (iterative cleanup and search, at most 2048 levels of XML with libxml2 older than 2.13, at most 4096 levels of decoding: "Encoding: Nesting level too deep"); GHSA-cj93-vc83-wgqv: the HTTP reader of SoapClient keeps the chunk sizes and the body length within bounds (unsigned sizes, explicit limits instead of a signed overflow check).
